{98} \\frac{r_k^2}{r_k + 1}.\n\\]\n\nFirst, we simplify the expression \\(\\frac{r_k^2}{r_k + 1}\\). Notice that since \\(r_k^{99} = 1\\), we have \\(r_k^{98} = \\frac{1}{r_k}\\). Therefore, we can rewrite the sum as:\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=1}^{98} \\frac{r_k^2}{r_k + 1}.\n\\]\n\nTo simplify this, we use the identity:\n\\[\n\\frac{r_k^2}{r_k + 1} = \\frac{r_k^2 + 1 - 1}{r_k + 1} = \\frac{r_k^2 + 1}{r_k + 1} - \\frac{1}{r_k + 1} = r_k + \\frac{1 - r_k}{r_k + 1} = r_k - 1 + \\frac{2}{r_k + 1}.\n\\]\n\nThus, the sum becomes:\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=1}^{98} \\left( r_k - 1 + \\frac{2}{r_k + 1} \\right) = \\sum_{k=1}^{98} r_k - 98 + \\sum_{k=1}^{98} \\frac{2}{r_k + 1}.\n\\]\n\nThe sum of the roots of the polynomial \\(x^{98} + x^{97} + \\dots + x + 1 = 0\\) is given by the negative of the coefficient of \\(x^{97}\\) divided by the leading coefficient, which is \\(-1\\). Therefore, \\(\\sum_{k=1}^{98} r_k = -1\\).\n\n","input_ids":[151644,8948,198,2610,525,1207,16948,11,3465,553,54364,14817,13,1446,525,264,10950,17847,13,151645,198,151644,872,198,50,3948,279,3491,3019,553,3019,13,20678,697,1590,4226,304,1124,79075,90,1112,92,382,10061,400,81,62,16,4779,400,81,62,17,4779,57960,67816,4779,400,81,15159,24,23,31716,387,279,19703,315,198,78045,87,47822,24,23,92,488,856,47822,24,22,92,488,856,47822,24,21,92,488,1124,67816,488,856,61,17,488,856,488,220,16,284,220,15,7110,60,9885,198,59,26056,37018,90,81,62,16,61,17,15170,81,62,16,488,220,16,92,488,1124,37018,90,81,62,17,61,17,15170,81,62,17,488,220,16,92,488,1124,67816,488,1124,37018,90,81,15159,24,23,92,61,17,15170,81,15159,24,23,92,488,220,16,92,7110,60,151645,198,151644,77091,198,1249,11625,279,2661,3491,11,582,1191,553,48083,429,279,47311,17767,87,47822,24,23,92,488,856,47822,24,22,92,488,856,47822,24,21,92,488,1124,67816,488,856,61,17,488,856,488,220,16,57758,374,279,220,24,24,339,31243,354,3075,47311,11,892,702,19703,429,525,279,220,24,24,339,19703,315,30326,43778,220,16,13,6771,1493,19703,387,17767,81,62,16,11,435,62,17,11,1124,67816,11,4